{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15958","headline":"赛神曲 · 王建","name":"赛神曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"男抱琵琶女作舞，主人再拜听神语。\n新妇上酒勿辞勤，使尔舅姑无所苦。\n椒浆湛湛桂座新，一双长箭系红巾。\n但愿牛羊满家宅，十月报赛南山神。\n青天无风水复碧，龙马上鞍牛服轭。\n纷纷醉舞踏衣裳，把酒路旁劝行客。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15958.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15958","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}